      "writtenOn": "2021-03-25T12:52:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for pointing this out. It is not a concern:\n\n1. After quiescent boot, the device will be asleep and therefore not interested in discovering new devices.\n\n2. During the first stage of a regular boot, isPowerStandbyOrTransient() \u003d\u003d true for a while. However, when boot completes, DeviceDiscoveryAction will be started, making any NewDeviceActions redundant.",
